-- הסכם עוז לתמורה (14.8.2011), §31 תוספת עוז לתמורה למנהלים ביישום חלקי
-- של הרפורמה: an existing principal of a school in part application, in
-- תשע"ב–תשע"ד, is entitled to §24's Oz LaTmura supplement for principals at
-- 7.5%, 15% and 22.5% — a quarter, a half and three quarters of its 30%;
-- and a new principal there, to the Oz LaTmura supplement "as detailed in
-- §31", which is read as §28's.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT vocabulary
IMPORT `oz-founding-common`
IMPORT `oz-founding-4`
IMPORT `oz-founding-16`
IMPORT `oz-founding-24`
IMPORT `oz-founding-25`
IMPORT `oz-founding-28`

§ `31 תוספת עוז לתמורה למנהלים ביישום חלקי של הרפורמה`

-- A principal serving in a school that applies the reform in part, in a
-- year of part application.
GIVEN y IS A NUMBER, e IS A `extent of the Oz reform`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a school of the Oz part application in` y e IF
    `a year of the Oz part application` y AND e EQUALS `the Oz reform in part`

§§ `31(א)`

-- (א): existing principals (§4(ו)) serving in schools in part application,
-- in תשע"ב–תשע"ד, are entitled to the Oz LaTmura supplement for principals
-- "כמפורט בסעיף 24", but at these rates: 7.5% in תשע"ב, 15% in תשע"ג, 22.5%
-- in תשע"ד. The referral brings §24's supplement whole (convention
-- reading.referral): on the combined salary alone ((ד)), in no other
-- supplement's base ((ה)), a separate component counting for what (ו)
-- lists.
@ref akn:art_31__para_a akn:art_31__para_a/p2 akn:art_31__para_a/p3 akn:art_31__para_a/p4
GIVEN y IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the Oz LaTmura supplement for principals rate in part application in` y IS
    `by the year of part application` y (7.5%) (15%) (22.5%)

GIVEN y IS A NUMBER, m IS A `Oz staff member`, e IS A `extent of the Oz reform`, c IS A `Oz principal's salary components`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the Oz LaTmura supplement for principals under section 31(א)` y m e c IS
    IF `an existing principal under the Oz agreement` m AND `a school of the Oz part application in` y e
    THEN fromMaybe 0 (`the Oz LaTmura supplement for principals rate in part application in` y)
         TIMES c's `the combined salary`
    ELSE 0

GIVEN p IS A `what an Oz salary component counts for`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the supplement under section 31(א) counts for` p IF
    `the Oz LaTmura supplement for principals counts for` p

§§ `31(ב)`

-- (ב): new principals (§4(ז)) serving in schools in part application, in
-- תשע"ב–תשע"ד, are entitled to the Oz LaTmura supplement "כמפורט בסעיף 31
-- לעיל" — the section (ב) is in, whose only rates are (א)'s, for existing
-- principals (F-oz-founding-31-a). The reading adopted (convention
-- reading.misprint): the referral is to §28, the teachers' supplement in
-- part application, as §25(ג) gives a new principal in full application
-- "תוספת עוז לתמורה המשולמת למורים" by §16 — and (ב) names that supplement,
-- not (א)'s "for principals". So: §28's rate of the year, on the combined
-- salary and the 2001 and 2008 supplements; and with it §16(ג)'s increase
-- of the 1987 and 1994 supplements, at the same rate, as §25(ג) brings it
-- (F-oz-founding-25-a) and §28 reads it (F-oz-founding-28-a). From
-- 28.5.2013 the steering committee's decision (§12) pays a new principal
-- by an existing principal's rules instead: `2013-05-28_oz-latmura_vaadat-higui-decision`.
@ref akn:art_31__para_b
GIVEN y IS A NUMBER, m IS A `Oz staff member`, e IS A `extent of the Oz reform`
      `the combined salary` IS A NUMBER
      `the 2001 supplement` IS A NUMBER
      `the 2008 supplement` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the Oz LaTmura supplement of a new principal under section 31(ב)` y m e `the combined salary` `the 2001 supplement` `the 2008 supplement` IS
    IF `a new principal under the Oz agreement` m AND `a school of the Oz part application in` y e
    THEN fromMaybe 0 (`the Oz LaTmura supplement rate in part application in` y)
         TIMES (`the combined salary` PLUS `the 2001 supplement` PLUS `the 2008 supplement`)
    ELSE 0

GIVEN y IS A NUMBER, m IS A `Oz staff member`, e IS A `extent of the Oz reform`
      `the supplement without the increase` IS A NUMBER @desc the 1987 or the 1994 supplement as it would be paid without §16(ג)
      `its value on the eve of the signing` IS A NUMBER @desc its shekel value on 13.8.2011
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `a new principal's 1987 or 1994 supplement under section 31(ב)` y m e `the supplement without the increase` `its value on the eve of the signing` IS
    IF `a new principal under the Oz agreement` m AND `a school of the Oz part application in` y e
    THEN `the 1987 or 1994 supplement at section 28's rate in` y `the supplement without the increase` `its value on the eve of the signing`
    ELSE `the supplement without the increase`

§§ `31 -- illustrations`

`an existing principal of a six-year school` MEANS `a serving principal of` `a six-year school, grades 7 to 12`

-- (א): 7.5% of a combined salary of 20,000 in תשע"ב, 22.5% in תשע"ד; none
-- in full application (§24(ד)'s 30%), nor to a new principal
#ASSERT `the Oz LaTmura supplement for principals under section 31(א)` `the school year 5772` `an existing principal of a six-year school` `the Oz reform in part` `components of 20,000 with 600, 400 and 300` EQUALS 1500
#ASSERT `the Oz LaTmura supplement for principals under section 31(א)` `the school year 5774` `an existing principal of a six-year school` `the Oz reform in part` `components of 20,000 with 600, 400 and 300` EQUALS 4500
#ASSERT `the Oz LaTmura supplement for principals under section 31(א)` `the school year 5772` `an existing principal of a six-year school` `the Oz reform in full` `components of 20,000 with 600, 400 and 300` EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the Oz LaTmura supplement for principals under section 31(א)` `the school year 5773` `a principal first appointed in 5773` `the Oz reform in part` `components of 20,000 with 600, 400 and 300` EQUALS 0
-- the rates are a quarter, a half and three quarters of §24(ד)'s
#ASSERT map `the Oz LaTmura supplement for principals rate in part application in` (LIST `the school year 5772`, `the school year 5773`, `the school year 5774`) EQUALS map (GIVEN f YIELD JUST (f TIMES `the Oz LaTmura supplement for principals rate`)) (LIST 1/4, 1/2, 3/4)
#ASSERT NOT `the supplement under section 31(א) counts for` `computing another percentage supplement on the combined salary`
-- (ב), as read: a new principal in תשע"ג, 21% of 20,700; none to an
-- existing one, who has (א)
#ASSERT `the Oz LaTmura supplement of a new principal under section 31(ב)` `the school year 5773` `a principal first appointed in 5773` `the Oz reform in part` 20000 400 300 EQUALS 4347
#ASSERT `the Oz LaTmura supplement of a new principal under section 31(ב)` `the school year 5773` `an existing principal of a six-year school` `the Oz reform in part` 20000 400 300 EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `a new principal's 1987 or 1994 supplement under section 31(ב)` `the school year 5773` `a principal first appointed in 5773` `the Oz reform in part` 520 500 EQUALS 625

-- F-oz-founding-31-a's evidence: (ב) refers to §31, the section it is in,
-- and the only rates §31 sets are (א)'s, which a new principal is not
-- entitled to.
`the section 31(ב) refers to` MEANS 31
`the section 31(ב) is in` MEANS 31
`section 31(ב) refers to itself, whose rates are not a new principal's` MEANS
        `the section 31(ב) refers to` EQUALS `the section 31(ב) is in`
    AND `a new principal under the Oz agreement` `a principal first appointed in 5773`
    AND `the Oz LaTmura supplement for principals under section 31(א)` `the school year 5773` `a principal first appointed in 5773` `the Oz reform in part` `components of 20,000 with 600, 400 and 300` EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `section 31(ב) refers to itself, whose rates are not a new principal's`
